Value SYNCHRONIZED (synchronized|unsynchronized)
Value STRATUM (\d+)
Value REFERENCE (\S+)
Value NOMINAL_FREQ (\S+)
Value ACTUAL_FREQ (\S+)
Value CLOCK_OFFSET (-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value ROOT_DELAY (-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value ROOT_DISPERSION (-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)

Start
  ^Clock is\s+${SYNCHRONIZED},\s+stratum\s+${STRATUM},\s+reference is\s+${REFERENCE}
  ^nominal freq is\s+${NOMINAL_FREQ}\s+Hz,\s+actual freq is\s+${ACTUAL_FREQ}\s+Hz
  ^clock offset is\s+${CLOCK_OFFSET}\s+sec,\s+root delay is\s+${ROOT_DELAY}\s+sec
  ^root dispersion is\s+${ROOT_DISPERSION}\s+msec -> Record
